## Prior and parallel work

Not derived from, and no code taken — but read while building this, and worth
reading by anyone evaluating it. These are the other public non-vendor attempts
at driver-level NVIDIA GPU virtualization:

- **nestrilabs/virtio-nvgpu** — https://github.com/nestrilabs/virtio-nvgpu
  A virtio transport with libkrun and KVM memslot mmap. The closest in shape to
  nvkvm's transport half.
- **straylight-software/isospin-microvm** — https://github.com/straylight-software/isospin-microvm
  A vsock transport with Firecracker workers borrowing a GPU-owning VM. A
  different answer to the same question about where the driver should live.

